Description: Fix the noisy internal microphone of MSI GF63 Thin laptops
 One of the two capture channels of the Realtek ALC233 is not wired to the
 microphone and only carries hiss. GF63 Mic Fix creates a clean microphone
 in PipeWire that uses only the working channel, removes the low hum and
 sets a sensible gain. Everything can be undone from the app.

